OL,3,GStrathclyde
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mainly dry start with a few
OL,6,Fbright or sunny intervals then cloud
OL,7,Fincreasing to bring a few showers from
OL,8,Flate morning. Some brighter spells may
OL,9,Fdevelop again later in the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FRather cloudy with some
OL,12,Fshowers at first but these soon fading
OL,13,Fout through the evening to allow some
OL,14,Fclearer spells. Mostly dry overnight
OL,15,Fbut clouding over for a time.
OL,16,
OL,17,CFriday:FStaying dry through the day.
OL,18,FSome bright or sunny spells to start,
OL,19,Fbut becoming somewhat cloudy, then
OL,20,Fclearer again in the evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
