OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Saturday to Monday:FMostly
OL,6,Fdry Saturday with some sunshine, the
OL,7,Fodd light shower possible around the
OL,8,Fcoast. Sunday mainly cloudy with a few
OL,9,Flight showers. Dry with bright or
OL,10,Fsunny spells on Monday.
